@@ -11,6 +11,10 @@ Roles shipped by default: **member**, **approver**, **admin**. Each user belongs
 | Create an expense (as owner) | yes | yes | yes |
 | Submit own draft | yes | yes | yes |
 | Submit someone else's expense | no | no | no |
+| See the approval queue | no | own team | all teams |
+| Approve or reject a submitted expense | no | own team | any team |
+| Approve or reject own expense | no | no | no |
+| Change a decision | no | no | no |
 
